g", "id": "1581073776564737", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296027_1581073779898070_3914771778197135889_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QU2nLacCmhIQ7kNvwFrobuZ&_nc_oc=Ado4V-zVK_Z6GSw-PvaHcrsJocW6T-ZKQiUMdWrNwbocr6Zspz83EeReLRX4kltFT2E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTAa4VJuiYpxGy3GywCqG3BYpczHC8-UihHDf9LrNoeVw&oe=6AF8A26E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_3_2560x1440.png", "id": "1045137615257453", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312231_1045137618590786_33954120887306011_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RNC9TPWyccwQ7kNvwHTg8Ql&_nc_oc=AdrHXbRsJJTJA1E_SHKvEX4Y5g0ZVyxJiEw8eCNj1HF51JMEnopUk7LE8RmZ7AskCPI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQvdsub203TuXAJBTiN-IWzwWXMcSkYGYLN6ujaKRlLew&oe=6AF88EAC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "universal_basic_asset_2560x1440.png", "id": "1418414611350713", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/767772105_1418414614684046_1921122656794256823_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QkMpMN3ENn0Q7kNvwEnpwSS&_nc_oc=AdrPGYvW9Pm9EEwrBSxCxE9wnvcOx5lAkTOgd4H9u754WnV01WNK0IMW3SBi2uvPlic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSL2UR86qh-dtmQVJQu_Yo6XQEkXQBHBg1aC1ibouLo4w&oe=6AF89AF7"}, "display_name": "Steal a Sigmon", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfae Get reward in [Discord.gg/StealaSigmon]\n\n\ud83e\udd8d Steal a Sigmon \ud83e\udd8d\n\nYou are genius to steal. Buy and steal sigma monsters to earn big money! Rebirth and unlock crazy rewards to troll other players!\n\n\ud83e\udd8d Content Include\n\n\u2022 Sigmons - 40+ Original and famous Monsters/Brainrots \ud83d\udc7e\n\u2022 5 Dazzling Mutation - rare looks with passive perks \u2728\n\u2022 20 Prank Items - black hole, sword, etc. \ud83e\uddf0\n\u2022 Candy Event - themed event with limited rewards \ud83c\udf6d\n\u2022 Rooftop Wardens - Guess what is used to be \ud83c\udf06\n\u2022 Rebirth Rewards - multipliers and milestone perks \ud83d\udd04\n\u2022 Admin Abuse - surprise global modifiers \u26a1\n\n\ud83e\udd2a How to Play\n\n\u2022 Buy a Sigmon - get your first one and start earning \ud83d\uded2\n\u2022 Steal - snatch Sigmon from other players in quick PvP chases \ud83e\uddd9\n\u2022 Generate Money - idle income plus upgrades to boost your yield \ud83d\udcb8\n\u2022 Rebirth - reset for multipliers and new perks \ud83d\udd04\n\u2022 Troll - use black hole, swords, poops and etc items to troll other players. \ud83e\uddf0\n\u2022 Heads-up - others can steal from you too-stay sharp! \u26a0\ufe0f", "short_description": "Buy, steal, and collect Sigmons, earn money, rebirth for upgrades, and troll other players in chaotic VR PvP!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://stealasigmonvr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KingKelley", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://stealasigmonvr.com/privacy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1407512785772947"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623551_2174949376787580_6044882838866007645_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4xcIsLg-sXcQ7kNvw