5_1418414614684046_1921122656794256823_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QkMpMN3ENn0Q7kNvwEnpwSS&_nc_oc=AdrPGYvW9Pm9EEwrBSxCxE9wnvcOx5lAkTOgd4H9u754WnV01WNK0IMW3SBi2uvPlic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSL2UR86qh-dtmQVJQu_Yo6XQEkXQBHBg1aC1ibouLo4w&oe=6AF89AF7"}, "display_name": "Steal a Sigmon", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfae Get reward in [Discord.gg/StealaSigmon]\n\n\ud83e\udd8d Steal a Sigmon \ud83e\udd8d\n\nYou are genius to steal. Buy and steal sigma monsters to earn big money! Rebirth and unlock crazy rewards to troll other players!\n\n\ud83e\udd8d Content Include\n\n\u2022 Sigmons - 40+ Original and famous Monsters/Brainrots \ud83d\udc7e\n\u2022 5 Dazzling Mutation - rare looks with passive perks \u2728\n\u2022 20 Prank Items - black hole, sword, etc. \ud83e\uddf0\n\u2022 Candy Event - themed event with limited rewards \ud83c\udf6d\n\u2022 Rooftop Wardens - Guess what is used to be \ud83c\udf06\n\u2022 Rebirth Rewards - multipliers and milestone perks \ud83d\udd04\n\u2022 Admin Abuse - surprise global modifiers \u26a1\n\n\ud83e\udd2a How to Play\n\n\u2022 Buy a Sigmon - get your first one and start earning \ud83d\uded2\n\u2022 Steal - snatch Sigmon from other players in quick PvP chases \ud83e\uddd9\n\u2022 Generate Money - idle income plus upgrades to boost your yield \ud83d\udcb8\n\u2022 Rebirth - reset for multipliers and new perks \ud83d\udd04\n\u2022 Troll - use black hole, swords, poops and etc items to troll other players. \ud83e\uddf0\n\u2022 Heads-up - others can steal from you too-stay sharp! \u26a0\ufe0f", "short_description": "Buy, steal, and collect Sigmons, earn money, rebirth for upgrades, and troll other players in chaotic VR PvP!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://stealasigmonvr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KingKelley", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://stealasigmonvr.com/priva